WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.020
Something happens to you when you leave this town

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.800
the farther away, the hazier it all gets

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:09.760
but me

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.620
and I've left

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.660
I remember all of it

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.900
help me

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:37.840
to the losers

00:00:40.275 --> 00:00:41.275
we made an oath

00:00:42.415 --> 00:00:43.415
swear?

00:00:46.495 --> 00:00:47.745
if it isn't dead

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.715
if it ever comes back

00:00:52.905 --> 00:00:53.905
we'll come back too

00:00:54.465 --> 00:00:55.515
we didn't stop it

00:00:56.045 --> 00:00:57.165
Pennywise

00:00:58.545 --> 00:00:59.545
the clown

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.020
we can't let it happen again

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.500
hello

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.560
Gabe

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:14.000
Gabe!

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.560
hello

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:22.760
please

00:01:30.935 --> 00:01:32.825
for 27 years

00:01:35.025 --> 00:01:36.795
I've dreamt of you

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.080
I craved you

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.720
I've missed you

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.120
we need to finish it

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:52.560
for good

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:54.980
I've seen all of us die

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.900
it consumes us from the inside, until we don't have a choice anymore

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.260
you lied

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.240
and I died

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:05.940
you lied

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:07.640
and I died

